{"team":"LV","col":"#C9D2DC","identity":"balanced","funnel":"balanced-D","plays_pg":58.7,"adot":6.7,"report_html":"<div class=\"report\"><h2>No Fixed Address</h2><p><strong>Brock Bowers</strong> is a genuine centerpiece, not an afterthought \u2014 <strong>22%</strong> of targets (league ~15%).</p><h3>The Offensive Blueprint</h3><p>They run downhill \u2014 mostly inside the tackles (16% to the edge vs ~25%), a gap/power scheme that trades big plays for a steady, grinding floor.</p><p>When they fall behind they abandon the run entirely \u2014 61% pass while trailing, so their pass-catchers have huge comeback-script ceilings.</p><p>By the numbers it's a struggling unit \u2014 a 39% success rate (below the 44% average).</p><p>It's a short, rhythm-based passing game \u2014 aDOT just <strong>6.7</strong> \u2014 that lives on YAC and checkdowns, boosting reception totals over big-play yardage.</p><h3>In the Red Zone</h3><p>Their red-zone identity is <strong>pass-first</strong> (59% pass), which puts scoring equity on <strong>Tre Tucker</strong>. And with the TE commanding 22% of targets, <strong>Brock Bowers</strong> is a live red-zone option too.</p><h2>Defense \u2014 No Obvious Seam</h2><p>They surrender <strong>118 rushing</strong> and <strong>224 passing</strong> yards per game (league ~120 / ~230). No dominant funnel \u2014 read it matchup by matchup.</p><p>They leak <strong>TE touchdowns</strong> (0.32/game vs ~0.24) \u2014 an anytime-TD spot to attack.</p><p>They leak <strong>RB rushing TDs</strong> (0.53/game vs ~0.46) \u2014 an anytime-TD spot to attack.</p><p>They leak <strong>WR1 receiving TDs</strong> (0.44/game vs ~0.38) \u2014 an anytime-TD spot to attack.</p><h2>The Betting Angles</h2><p>Bottom line: their pass-catchers have massive ceilings in comeback scripts (fade-material as underdogs); <strong>opposing TE anytime-TD</strong> is a repeatable angle.</p><p><em>Built on 2024\u201325 data; the profile rebuilds through the season as the current staff and roster set their own tendencies.</em></p></div>","depth":{"QB":[{"name":"Kirk Cousins","slot":"QB1","starter":true,"td":10,"props":{"Comp":7.6,"Att":11.5,"Pass Yds":83.92,"Pass TD":0.57,"INT":0.55,"Rush Yds":4.18}},{"name":"Fernando Mendoza","slot":"QB2","starter":false,"td":12,"props":{"Comp":5.65,"Att":8.72,"Pass Yds":61.58,"Pass TD":0.42,"INT":0.46,"Rush Yds":11.78}}],"RB":[{"name":"Ashton Jeanty","slot":"RB1","starter":true,"td":41,"props":{"Rush Att":18.0,"Rush Yds":66.66,"Tgt":4.4,"Rec":3.44,"Rec Yds":22.69}},{"name":"Dylan Laube","slot":"RB3","starter":false,"td":14,"props":{"Rush Att":5.53,"Rush Yds":19.1,"Tgt":1.49,"Rec":1.18,"Rec Yds":8.49}},{"name":"Roman Hemby","slot":"RB4","starter":false,"td":12,"props":{"Rush Att":2.11,"Rush Yds":8.81,"Tgt":0.78,"Rec":0.52,"Rec Yds":3.69}}],"WR":[{"name":"Tre Tucker","slot":"WR1","starter":true,"td":24,"props":{"Tgt":6.05,"Rec":3.67,"Rec Yds":46.31,"Rec TD":0.28}},{"name":"Jalen Nailor","slot":"WR2","starter":true,"td":22,"props":{"Tgt":3.19,"Rec":1.68,"Rec Yds":24.35,"Rec TD":0.25}},{"name":"Jack Bech","slot":"WR3","starter":true,"td":12,"props":{"Tgt":3.92,"Rec":2.62,"Rec Yds":30.98,"Rec TD":0.12}},{"name":"Malik Benson","slot":"WR4","starter":false,"td":13,"props":{"Tgt":2.83,"Rec":1.54,"Rec Yds":18.95,"Rec TD":0.14}},{"name":"Dont'e Thornton Jr.","slot":"WR5","starter":false,"td":8,"props":{"Tgt":2.83,"Rec":1.27,"Rec Yds":15.91,"Rec TD":0.09}}],"TE":[{"name":"Brock Bowers","slot":"TE1","starter":true,"td":28,"props":{"Tgt":6.1,"Rec":4.57,"Rec Yds":48.33,"Rec TD":0.34}},{"name":"Michael Mayer","slot":"TE2","starter":false,"td":13,"props":{"Tgt":4.6,"Rec":2.73,"Rec Yds":25.71,"Rec TD":0.15}},{"name":"Ian Thomas","slot":"TE3","starter":false,"td":5,"props":{"Tgt":2.55,"Rec":1.5,"Rec Yds":14.0,"Rec TD":0.05}}]},"schedule":[{"week":1,"ha":"vs","opp":"MIA","opp_col":"#2CD3C6","gid":"2026_01_MIA_LV","spread":"\u22123.0","proj":"22\u201319","win":true},{"week":2,"ha":"@","opp":"LAC","opp_col":"#3AC7F0","gid":"2026_02_LV_LAC",